{"n12846421710":{"checked":"2026-08-22","facts":[{"k":"facility_identity","v":"楠川温泉","n":1,"official":true,"conflict":false,"src":["town.yakushima.kagoshima.jp","yakukan.jp"],"urls":["https://www.town.yakushima.kagoshima.jp/soshiki/sangyo_shinko/onsen/698.html","https://yakukan.jp/spot/7011.html"]},{"k":"opening_hours","v":"入浴時間は9:00〜20:00。","n":1,"official":true,"conflict":false,"src":["town.yakushima.kagoshima.jp","yakukan.jp"],"urls":["https://www.town.yakushima.kagoshima.jp/soshiki/sangyo_shinko/onsen/698.html","https://yakukan.jp/spot/7011.html"]},{"k":"closed_days","v":"休業日は毎月10日・20日・30日。","n":1,"official":true,"conflict":false,"src":["town.yakushima.kagoshima.jp","yakukan.jp"],"urls":["https://www.town.yakushima.kagoshima.jp/soshiki/sangyo_shinko/onsen/698.html","https://yakukan.jp/spot/7011.html"]},{"k":"price","v":"入浴料は大人300円、小人150円。","n":1,"official":true,"conflict":false,"src":["town.yakushima.kagoshima.jp","yakukan.jp"],"urls":["https://www.town.yakushima.kagoshima.jp/soshiki/sangyo_shinko/onsen/698.html","https://yakukan.jp/spot/7011.html"]},{"k":"access","v":"屋久島町楠川1364番地5。宮之浦港からバスで約10分、またはバス停「楠川温泉入口」から徒歩10分。","n":1,"official":true,"conflict":false,"src":["town.yakushima.kagoshima.jp","yakukan.jp"],"urls":["https://www.town.yakushima.kagoshima.jp/soshiki/sangyo_shinko/onsen/698.html","https://yakukan.jp/spot/7011.html"]},{"k":"parking","v":"駐車場は5台。","n":1,"official":true,"conflict":false,"src":["town.yakushima.kagoshima.jp","yakukan.jp"],"urls":["https://www.town.yakushima.kagoshima.jp/soshiki/sangyo_shinko/onsen/698.html","https://yakukan.jp/spot/7011.html"]},{"k":"bring_items","v":"タオル・石鹸・シャンプー等は持参する。","n":1,"official":true,"conflict":false,"src":["town.yakushima.kagoshima.jp","yakukan.jp"],"urls":["https://www.town.yakushima.kagoshima.jp/soshiki/sangyo_shinko/onsen/698.html","https://yakukan.jp/spot/7011.html"]},{"k":"facilities","v":"湯之河沿いの共同浴場で、浴槽は8〜10人程度。","n":1,"official":true,"conflict":false,"src":["town.yakushima.kagoshima.jp","yakukan.jp"],"urls":["https://www.town.yakushima.kagoshima.jp/soshiki/sangyo_shinko/onsen/698.html","https://yakukan.jp/spot/7011.html"]},{"k":"solo_insight","v":{"title":"楠川温泉は10・20・30日の休みと持参品を宮之浦港バス10分から整える","insight":"「入浴時間は9:00〜20:00。」でも「休業日は毎月10日・20日・30日。」なので、屋久島での日付を先に外します。「入浴料は大人300円、小人150円。」で、「タオル・石鹸・シャンプー等は持参する。」共同浴場です。「屋久島町楠川1364番地5。宮之浦港からバスで約10分、またはバス停『楠川温泉入口』から徒歩10分。」から、港からバスで行くかを決めます。「駐車場は5台。」なので車利用は満車を前提にせず、「湯之河沿いの共同浴場で、浴槽は8〜10人程度。」の小さな湯へ必要品を整えて向かう一人の計画です。","anchors":["楠川温泉","入浴時間は9:00〜20:00。","休業日は毎月10日・20日・30日。","入浴料は大人300円、小人150円。","屋久島町楠川1364番地5。宮之浦港からバスで約10分、またはバス停「楠川温泉入口」から徒歩10分。","駐車場は5台。","タオル・石鹸・シャンプー等は持参する。","湯之河沿いの共同浴場で、浴槽は8〜10人程度。"],"quality":"grounded","policyVersion":"official-provenance-v2"},"n":1,"official":true,"conflict":false,"src":["town.yakushima.kagoshima.jp","yakukan.jp"],"urls":["https://www.town.yakushima.kagoshima.jp/soshiki/sangyo_shinko/onsen/698.html","https://yakukan.jp/spot/7011.html"]}]},"n13991490012":{"checked":"2026-08-12","facts":[{"conflict":true,"k":"price","n":1,"official":true,"src":["town.kikai.lg.jp"],"urls":["http://www.town.kikai.lg.jp/nousei/sangyo/nogyo/simattyunouhausu.html"],"v":2500},{"conflict":true,"k":"price","n":1,"official":true,"src":["town.kikai.lg.jp"],"urls":["http://www.town.kikai.lg.jp/nousei/sangyo/nogyo/simattyunouhausu.html"],"v":1500},{"conflict":false,"k":"bring_towel","n":1,"official":false,"src":["town.kikai.lg.jp"],"urls":["http://www.town.kikai.lg.jp/nousei/sangyo/nogyo/simattyunouhausu.html"],"v":"required"},{"conflict":false,"k":"reservation","n":1,"official":false,"src":["town.kikai.lg.jp"],"urls":["http://www.town.kikai.lg.jp/nousei/sangyo/nogyo/simattyunouhausu.html"],"v":"possible"},{"conflict":false,"k":"luggage","n":1,"official":false,"src":["town.kikai.lg.jp"],"urls":["http://www.town.kikai.lg.jp/nousei/sangyo/nogyo/simattyunouhausu.html"],"v":"locker"},{"conflict":false,"k":"access","n":1,"official":false,"src":["amamishimbun.co.jp"],"urls":["https://amamishimbun.co.jp/2025/09/11/58068/"],"v":"public"}]},"n1631143932":{"checked":"2026-08-22","facts":[{"k":"facility_identity","v":"中種子町温泉保養センター","n":1,"official":true,"conflict":false,"src":["town.nakatane.kagoshima.jp"],"urls":["https://town.nakatane.kagoshima.jp/fukushi/machinojoho/kanko/shukuhaku-onsen/onsen/onsenhoyocenter.html"]},{"k":"opening_hours","v":"4月〜9月は11:00〜21:00、10月〜3月は11:00〜20:30。","n":1,"official":true,"conflict":false,"src":["town.nakatane.kagoshima.jp"],"urls":["https://town.nakatane.kagoshima.jp/fukushi/machinojoho/kanko/shukuhaku-onsen/onsen/onsenhoyocenter.html"]},{"k":"closed_days","v":"休館日は毎週木曜日と12月31日〜1月2日。","n":1,"official":true,"conflict":false,"src":["town.nakatane.kagoshima.jp"],"urls":["https://town.nakatane.kagoshima.jp/fukushi/machinojoho/kanko/shukuhaku-onsen/onsen/onsenhoyocenter.html"]},{"k":"price","v":"中学生以上は一人一回400円。","n":1,"official":true,"conflict":false,"src":["town.nakatane.kagoshima.jp"],"urls":["https://town.nakatane.kagoshima.jp/fukushi/machinojoho/kanko/shukuhaku-onsen/onsen/onsenhoyocenter.html"]},{"k":"access","v":"所在地は鹿児島県熊毛郡中種子町坂井5540番地1で、熊野海岸と自然レクリエーション村の近く。","n":1,"official":true,"conflict":false,"src":["town.nakatane.kagoshima.jp"],"urls":["https://town.nakatane.kagoshima.jp/fukushi/machinojoho/kanko/shukuhaku-onsen/onsen/onsenhoyocenter.html"]},{"k":"facilities","v":"男湯・女湯ともサウナを備え、気泡風呂、低周波風呂、水風呂2種、大広間がある。","n":1,"official":true,"conflict":false,"src":["town.nakatane.kagoshima.jp"],"urls":["https://town.nakatane.kagoshima.jp/fukushi/machinojoho/kanko/shukuhaku-onsen/onsen/onsenhoyocenter.html"]},{"k":"amenities","v":"石けん・シャンプー・タオルは持参推奨で販売もあり、無料コインロッカーとキャッシュレス決済を利用できる。","n":1,"official":true,"conflict":false,"src":["town.nakatane.kagoshima.jp"],"urls":["https://town.nakatane.kagoshima.jp/fukushi/machinojoho/kanko/shukuhaku-onsen/onsen/onsenhoyocenter.html"]},{"k":"solo_insight","v":{"title":"中種子町温泉保養センターは夏21時・冬20時30分を400円と熊野海岸近くで選ぶ","insight":"「4月〜9月は11:00〜21:00、10月〜3月は11:00〜20:30。」なので、冬期は夏より30分早い終了として組みます。「休館日は毎週木曜日と12月31日〜1月2日。」を避け、「中学生以上は一人一回400円。」で入ります。「所在地は鹿児島県熊毛郡中種子町坂井5540番地1で、熊野海岸と自然レクリエーション村の近く。」です。「男湯・女湯ともサウナを備え、気泡風呂、低周波風呂、水風呂2種、大広間がある。」ため、タオル等を持参し、無料ロッカーとキャッシュレス決済を使う温浴動線にします。","anchors":["中種子町温泉保養センター","4月〜9月は11:00〜21:00、10月〜3月は11:00〜20:30。","休館日は毎週木曜日と12月31日〜1月2日。","中学生以上は一人一回400円。","所在地は鹿児島県熊毛郡中種子町坂井5540番地1で、熊野海岸と自然レクリエーション村の近く。","男湯・女湯ともサウナを備え、気泡風呂、低周波風呂、水風呂2種、大広間がある。","石けん・シャンプー・タオルは持参推奨で販売もあり、無料コインロッカーとキャッシュレス決済を利用できる。"],"quality":"grounded","policyVersion":"official-provenance-v2"},"n":1,"official":true,"conflict":false,"src":["town.nakatane.kagoshima.jp"],"urls":["https://town.nakatane.kagoshima.jp/fukushi/machinojoho/kanko/shukuhaku-onsen/onsen/onsenhoyocenter.html"]}]},"n4528240107":{"checked":"2026-08-11","facts":[{"conflict":false,"k":"hours","n":1,"official":false,"src":["tokara.jp"],"urls":["http://www.tokara.jp/tourism/guide_kodakara/%E6%B9%AF%E6%B3%8A%E6%B8%A9%E6%B3%89/"],"v":"24時間"},{"conflict":false,"k":"open_period","n":1,"official":false,"src":["kagoshima-kankou.com"],"urls":["https://www.kagoshima-kankou.com/guide/10631"],"v":"year_round"},{"conflict":false,"k":"price","n":1,"official":false,"src":["kagoshima-kankou.com"],"urls":["https://www.kagoshima-kankou.com/guide/10631"],"v":0},{"conflict":false,"k":"hours","n":2,"official":false,"src":["tokara.jp","kagoshima-kankou.com"],"urls":["http://www.tokara.jp/tourism/guide_kodakara/%E6%B9%AF%E6%B3%8A%E6%B8%A9%E6%B3%89/","https://www.kagoshima-kankou.com/guide/10631"],"v":"24時間利用可能"},{"conflict":false,"k":"first_timer","n":1,"official":false,"src":["onsen.unknownjapan.co.jp"],"urls":["https://onsen.unknownjapan.co.jp/article/2016/08/20/52"],"v":"custom_exists"},{"conflict":false,"k":"unstaffed","n":1,"official":false,"src":["onsenshouyou.net"],"urls":["https://onsenshouyou.net/archives/41224"],"v":"yes"},{"conflict":false,"k":"luggage","n":1,"official":false,"src":["onsenshouyou.net"],"urls":["https://onsenshouyou.net/archives/41224"],"v":"none"},{"conflict":false,"k":"wash_area","n":1,"official":false,"src":["onsenshouyou.net"],"urls